    object, it began moving
    and emitting a red light, followed by a

    screeching sound.

    We tried
    to go back to the ******* to prevent ******* damage, but the

    order was given
    to completely cover the object and rush to ******

    laboratory.

    I could
    not figure out what that was, but I do know one thing: it is

    not ours.'
